<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 117 0 R/E(Behind that apparent simplicity is an elaborate operation. UNIQLOs specialty-store retailer of private-label apparel (SPA) model connects planning, materials, production and selling. Long-term manufacturing partnerships, direct material purchasing and work with Toray Industries help translate product ideas into repeatable ranges.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[0]>>
