<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 117 0 R/E(But basics do not sell themselves. The wrong colour, size or quantity can turn a reliable favourite into a warehouse problem. Through the Ariake Project and information from stores, Fast Retailing has sought to tighten the conversation between customer demand, inventory and production.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[1]>>
