239 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 118 0 R/E(Founded in A Coruña in 1975, Zara gives shoppers a reason to return. Collections evolve, silhouettes change and the next visit may bring something the last one did not. Freshness is not simply a marketing flourish; it shapes how the business operates.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[2]>>
