240 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 118 0 R/E(Store feedback, sales information and trend observations help inform design and production decisions. Shorter runs, proximity sourcing and Inditexs centralised logistics can allow more decisions to be made during a season, rather than relying entirely on predictions months in advance.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj
241 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 118 0 R/E(There is a price to that flexibility. Frequent changes require coordination, and a faster response is only valuable when the new merchandise earns its keep. Zara cannot afford to confuse movement with profitable demand.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[4]>>
