242 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 118 0 R/E(The store itself is changing too. Inditex has emphasised larger, more productive locations, connected digital channels and a carefully managed shopping experience. The business of being first increasingly depends on what happens behind the scenes as much as what appears on the rack.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[5]>>
