<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 126 0 R/E(a 32.5-day improvement. Closing inventory fell from 21.1% of annual revenue in FY2022 to 15.0% in FY2025.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj
324 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 126 0 R/E(Inditex still held the lead: its FY2025 closing inventory amounted to just 8.2% of revenue. But the recovery matters. A retailer can improve how it matches stock to sales even without changing its underlying brand philosophy.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[3]>>
