326 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 126 0 R/E(continuity and scale place a premium on getting quantities, colours and timing right. Those mechanisms are plausible explanations, not proof of what caused the group-level gap.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj
327 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 126 0 R/E(Nor is speed a free prize. A shop with too little inventory can lose sales; one clearing racks through steep discounts can lift turnover while sacrificing margin. The useful question is not how fast garments disappear, but whether they sell at the right price and remain available when customers want them.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj
328 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 126 0 R/E(COMEBACK BEHIND THE GAP)/Pg 24 0 R/K[7]>>
