<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 126 0 R/E(The results fit the broad business playbooks. Inditexs shorter runs, proximity sourcing and in-season allocation may help it respond to demand without carrying as much stock. Fast Retailings product )/Pg 24 0 R/K[9]>>
