332 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 126 0 R/E(Inditex has been the more inventory-efficient group over these five years. Fast Retailing, meanwhile, offers a reminder that a difficult inventory year need not become a permanent one.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj
333 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 126 0 R/E(Stock that moves is better than stock that waits„but only if the economics of the sale still work. That brings us to the next test: profit.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[12]>>
