355 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(Fast Retailing supplied its own twist in FY2025. Gross margin edged down from 53.90% to 53.78%. Operating margin, however, climbed from 16.14% to 16.59%.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj
356 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(The answer lies below gross profit. SG&A fell from 38.27% to 37.57% of revenue, a 0.70-percentage-point improvement in expense intensity that more than offset the small gross-margin decline, after other operating items. Profitability, it turns out, is not decided solely at the factory gate.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj
357 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(A Better Year, Despite a Weaker Margin)/Pg 28 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj
358 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(An attractive margin is less impressive if a business needs a huge asset base to generate it. In FY2025, Inditex reported asset turnover of 1.13× and net return on assets of 17.7%, compared with Fast Retailings 0.91× and 12.3%. These group-level measures also reflect differences in cash holdings, leases and asset composition; they are not store-level returns.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj
359 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(Beyond the Sale)/Pg 28 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj
360 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(Inditexs lead in reported margins is clear, and its FY2025 asset returns strengthen the picture. What is less clear is how much credit belongs to Zaras speed rather than the wider groups pricing, mix and operating choices.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj
361 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(Fast Retailings improving operating margin makes a different point: better expense control can lift profit even when gross margin slips. Scale does not guarantee the highest margin; responsiveness need not come at the expense of one.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj
362 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(But profit is not cash. New stores, technology and leases still have to be paid for.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj
363 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(The Ledgers Take)/Pg 28 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj
